<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<span id="docs-internal-guid-31de3fd4-2639-ea87-171c-639f06deb091"><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Contact.FirstName},</font></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you for your interest in the nationally ranked MS program in biomedical engineering at Arizona State University. ASU’s School of Biological and Health Systems Engineering is actively engaged in pushing the boundaries of science, medicine and engineering in areas ranging from cardiovascular engineering, biovirtual reality and neuroengineering to synthetic biology, tissue engineering and regenerative medicine. The Master of Science degree in biomedical engineering is a rigorous 30-credit hour program in which you will be guided by our world-class faculty to complete courses within your focus area and complete either a thesis or an applied project.</font></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></span></p><span id="docs-internal-guid-31de3fd4-263d-2465-0934-acfd14b96d5a" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Areas of study include: &nbsp;</span></p><div dir="ltr" style="margin-left:0pt;"><table style="border:none;border-collapse:collapse"><colgroup><col width="301"><col width="323"></colgroup><tbody><tr style="height:0px"><td style="border-left:solid #ffffff 0px;border-right:solid #ffffff 0px;border-bottom:solid #ffffff 0px;border-top:solid #ffffff 0px;vertical-align:top;padding:7px 7px 7px 7px"><ul style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; vertical-align: baseline;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">biomaterials, biosensors, biomarkers and biomimetic materials</span></p></li><li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; vertical-align: baseline;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">molecular, cellular and tissue engineering</span><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre;">	</span></span></p></li></ul><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span></p></td><td style="border-left:solid #ffffff 0px;border-right:solid #ffffff 0px;border-bottom:solid #ffffff 0px;border-top:solid #ffffff 0px;vertical-align:top;padding:7px 7px 7px 7px"><ul style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; vertical-align: baseline;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">neural and rehabilitation engineering</span></p></li><li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; vertical-align: baseline;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">synthetic and systems biology</span></p></li><li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; vertical-align: baseline;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">biomedical imaging</span></p></li></ul><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div></font></span><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><a href="https://ex2010.asu.edu/owa/redir.aspx?&amp;URL=https%3a%2f%2furldefense.proofpoint.com%2fv2%2furl%3fu%3dhttp-3A__sbhse.engineering.asu.edu_academics_currentstudents_graduate_newgrad_international_msadmitlist_%26d%3dCwMFaQ%26c%3dAGbYxfJbXK67KfXyGqyv2Ejiz41FqQuZFk4A-1IxfAU%26r%3dXzz0RMAwrtSHb0bBMRomSQgVV74aKzD7JzD2ycB9Cto%26m%3d-m_V96dN4ZXeh2L-w75g_jOUwNwiD-CVLQbc9Big32I%26s%3dtivxZYLiA4ckc_DaGMERaHMX2fLHsG38mU1VIRYxVN4%26e%3d"><br></a></span></font></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><a href="https://ex2010.asu.edu/owa/redir.aspx?&amp;URL=https%3a%2f%2furldefense.proofpoint.com%2fv2%2furl%3fu%3dhttp-3A__sbhse.engineering.asu.edu_academics_currentstudents_graduate_newgrad_international_msadmitlist_%26d%3dCwMFaQ%26c%3dAGbYxfJbXK67KfXyGqyv2Ejiz41FqQuZFk4A-1IxfAU%26r%3dXzz0RMAwrtSHb0bBMRomSQgVV74aKzD7JzD2ycB9Cto%26m%3d-m_V96dN4ZXeh2L-w75g_jOUwNwiD-CVLQbc9Big32I%26s%3dtivxZYLiA4ckc_DaGMERaHMX2fLHsG38mU1VIRYxVN4%26e%3d">Application process and requirements</a> must be completed to be considered, including priority deadlines, letters of recommendation, financial assistance, and prerequisites. </span></font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.15; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">There are no minimum</span><span style="color: rgb(31, 73, 125); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.15; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.15; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">GRE test scores required to gain entrance into the program. However, competitive scores increase an applicant’s likelihood of acceptance. The most recent average GPA of admitted applicants was 3.45, while the average GRE sub scores were 154, 156 and 3.8 for verbal, quantitative, and analytical, respectively.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"> </font></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><a href="https://students.asu.edu/graduate/proficiency" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.15; text-decoration: none;"><span style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">English proficiency requirements</span></a><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.15; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> have been established by the Office of Graduate Education</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(31, 73, 125); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><br></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><a href="http://sbhse.engineering.asu.edu/research/" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Research opportunities</span></a><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> are available for graduate students of all levels to increase knowledge in their discipline while improving an understanding of industry-used practices and procedures.</span></font></p><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please contact our office should you have any additional questions during your application process. &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="color: rgb(31, 73, 125); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"> </font></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Kind regards,</font></span></p><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">School of Biological and Health Systems Engineering</font></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Advising 480-965-3028 | Fax 480-727-7624</font></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Email Address: </span><span style="text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><a href="mailto:sbhse-advising@asu.edu" style="text-decoration:none;">sbhse@asu.edu</a></span></font></p><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></div></span>]]></td>
